00:01:30.486 --> 00:01:32.386
AMERICANS IN WORLD WAR II.

00:01:32.387 --> 00:01:35.022
&gt;&gt; DID YOU HEAR THAT?

00:01:35.023 --> 00:01:36.190
BERLIN WALL, BAD.

00:01:36.191 --> 00:01:37.792
BORDER WALL, ALSO BAD.

00:01:37.793 --> 00:01:40.294
INDEED, BAD, VERY MUCH LIKE

00:01:40.295 --> 00:01:41.362
INTERNING THE JAPANESE DIRECT

