WHATEVER.

00:01:47.336 --> 00:01:48.970
WALLS ARE BAD.

00:01:48.971 --> 00:01:49.337
OKAY?

00:01:49.338 --> 00:01:50.972
SO FAR THAT HAS BEEN THE SUM

00:01:50.973 --> 00:01:52.807
TOTAL OF WHAT WE KNOW ABOUT

00:01:52.808 --> 00:01:54.675
BETO O'ROURKE'S POLICY VIEWS.

00:01:54.676 --> 00:01:55.877
THAT AND HE WENT TO THE

00:01:55.878 --> 00:01:56.844
