WE KNOW BECAUSE HE PUT IT ON

00:01:58.480 --> 00:01:58.980
INSTAGRAM.

00:01:58.981 --> 00:02:01.215
THANKFULLY NOW WE KNOW EVEN

00:02:01.216 --> 00:02:01.816
MORE.

