00:02:20.002 --> 00:02:21.269
THINGS, INCLUDING BORDER

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:21.636
WALLS.

00:02:21.637 --> 00:02:24.972
WALLS ARE BAD, O'ROURKE

00:02:24.973 --> 00:02:25.406
EXPLAINED.

00:02:25.407 --> 00:02:27.208
NOT JUST BECAUSE THEY INTERN

00:02:27.209 --> 00:02:28.342
PERFECTLY DECENT JAPANESE

00:02:28.343 --> 00:02:29.510
PEOPLE BUT BECAUSE THEY

00:02:29.511 --> 00:02:31.312
