00:02:49.698 --> 00:02:50.031
WHOA!

00:02:50.032 --> 00:02:51.832
WE KILLED PEOPLE.

00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:53.401
WE DIDN'T EVEN KNOW IT.

00:02:53.402 --> 00:02:54.735
